      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to the RFC, the mDNS character equivalent comparison is done on lowercase letters. Therefore, I don\u0027t think you can simply change lowercase to uppercase for all mDNS classes. Perhaps you can create a new method for uppercase usage.",
